Total history text uses the declared precision and grouping separators.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight total-history --accounts 'Assets:Cash'

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening
2024-01-01 Opening
  Assets:Cash  2.005 SEK
  Equity:Opening
2024-01-02 Increase
  Assets:Cash  9997.995 SEK
  Equity:Opening

========== OUTPUT ==========

2024-01-01       2.01 SEK
2024-01-02  10,000.00 SEK

========== WARNINGS ==========
